Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:03:29.74,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 辛辛那提 ATP1000 1/4决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:03:29.74,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}科博利 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}2-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}3 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}4{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 保罗 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.16,0:00:02.00,EN,,0,0,0,,here. Flavio, great to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.16,0:00:02.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,弗拉维奥，很高兴见到你。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:03.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.00,0:00:03.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜你。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.04,0:00:04.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Another big battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.04,0:00:04.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,又是一场恶战。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.32,0:00:05.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Two, three setters in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.32,0:00:05.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,接连打了两场三盘大战。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.84,0:00:06.88,EN,,0,0,0,,You're coming up clutch
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.84,0:00:06.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,每逢关键时刻，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.88,0:00:08.96,EN,,0,0,0,,in the big moments.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.88,0:00:08.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,你总能站出来。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.96,0:00:11.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, another third set, another fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.96,0:00:11.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊，又是一场苦战。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.68,0:00:17.04,EN,,0,0,0,,And like like always that I a thing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.68,0:00:17.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,这就像我一直以来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.04,0:00:20.72,EN,,0,0,0,,that I like to to do in my career.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.04,0:00:20.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,在职业生涯里喜欢做的事。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.72,0:00:22.72,EN,,0,0,0,,I always like to to fight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.72,0:00:22.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我总是喜欢去拼，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.72,0:00:24.88,EN,,0,0,0,,and have a third set match.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.72,0:00:24.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,打满三盘。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.88,0:00:28.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Today is my fourth in in the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.88,0:00:28.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是我本站第四场三盘。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.80,0:00:31.28,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I felt a little bit tired,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.80,0:00:31.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我确实有点累，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.28,0:00:34.00,EN,,0,0,0,,but still very, very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.28,0:00:34.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,但还是非常非常开心。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.00,0:00:35.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Let's talk a little bit about the tennis here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.00,0:00:35.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们聊聊比赛本身。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.84,0:00:37.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Tommy got off to such a great start
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.84,0:00:37.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,汤米开局状态很好，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.52,0:00:38.80,EN,,0,0,0,,in that first set.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.52,0:00:38.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,首盘就打得不错。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.80,0:00:40.96,EN,,0,0,0,,He seemed to be really the aggressive one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.80,0:00:40.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,他反倒像是更主动的一方。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.96,0:00:42.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Were you were you wanting
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.96,0:00:42.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,你是不是想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.00,0:00:43.92,EN,,0,0,0,,to change the the ball position
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.00,0:00:43.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,调整站位，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.92,0:00:46.08,EN,,0,0,0,,or for you to be more aggressive after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.92,0:00:46.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,还是想让自己更主动？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:48.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, before the match I was talking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:48.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的，赛前
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.32,0:00:50.72,EN,,0,0,0,,with the team and we said
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.32,0:00:50.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我和团队聊过，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.72,0:00:53.68,EN,,0,0,0,,that maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.72,0:00:53.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,也许可以
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.68,0:00:56.80,EN,,0,0,0,,to start a little bit forward
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.68,0:00:56.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,站位可以靠前一点，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.80,0:01:00.16,EN,,0,0,0,,but he was serving pretty well
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.80,0:01:00.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,但他首盘发球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.16,0:01:01.04,EN,,0,0,0,,on the first set
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.16,0:01:01.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,发得相当好，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.04,0:01:04.32,EN,,0,0,0,,and zero chance on my on my return
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.04,0:01:04.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我一个接发球机会都没抓住，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.32,0:01:07.36,EN,,0,0,0,,and didn't start really well also
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.32,0:01:07.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且自己发球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.36,0:01:08.40,EN,,0,0,0,,with my serve.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.36,0:01:08.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,开局也不太好。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.40,0:01:10.96,EN,,0,0,0,,So I had to change something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.40,0:01:10.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我必须做点改变。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.96,0:01:14.88,EN,,0,0,0,,We we change the position
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.96,0:01:14.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们调整了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.88,0:01:18.24,EN,,0,0,0,,on the on the return and we I try
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.88,0:01:18.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,接发球的站位，我试着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.24,0:01:21.20,EN,,0,0,0,,to to hit more for than than back end
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.24,0:01:21.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,更多往前压而不是站得靠后，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.20,0:01:24.88,EN,,0,0,0,,and I think it works also today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.20,0:01:24.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得今天这一招也奏效了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.88,0:01:28.24,EN,,0,0,0,,I found also the rhythm
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.88,0:01:28.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我也找到了节奏，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.24,0:01:29.28,EN,,0,0,0,,with my shape
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.24,0:01:29.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,手感
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.28,0:01:32.80,EN,,0,0,0,,with my physical condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.28,0:01:32.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,和身体状态都跟上来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.80,0:01:38.64,EN,,0,0,0,,I I hit my M&M's and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.80,0:01:38.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,我吃了我的M&M豆，然后……
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.64,0:01:40.00,EN,,0,0,0,,I I I was going to ask you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.64,0:01:40.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,我正想问你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.00,0:01:41.36,EN,,0,0,0,,about that because your your first
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.00,0:01:41.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,这个，因为你的一发
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.36,0:01:43.28,EN,,0,0,0,,serve especially continued to get better
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.36,0:01:43.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,尤其是越打
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.28,0:01:44.80,EN,,0,0,0,,and better as the match went on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.28,0:01:44.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,越好。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.80,0:01:47.36,EN,,0,0,0,,I was wondering if it was the M&M's.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.80,0:01:47.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,我在想是不是M&M豆的功劳。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.36,0:01:49.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, chocolate helped me a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.36,0:01:49.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊，巧克力帮了我大忙。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.20,0:01:50.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Um
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.20,0:01:50.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.40,0:01:52.64,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean that's a that's a big cup of M&M's.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.40,0:01:52.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,那可真是一大杯M&M豆啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.64,0:01:54.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Flavio.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.64,0:01:54.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,弗拉维奥。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.16,0:01:55.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah. man,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.16,0:01:55.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊，老兄，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.52,0:01:58.40,EN,,0,0,0,,I only eat four for every changeover.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.52,0:01:58.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,我每次换边就吃四颗。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.40,0:01:59.44,EN,,0,0,0,,What what color did you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.40,0:01:59.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,什么颜色
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.44,0:02:00.56,EN,,0,0,0,,have or doesn't matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.44,0:02:00.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,都行，还是有讲究？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.56,0:02:02.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter. Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.56,0:02:02.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,无所谓，什么颜色都行。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.00,0:02:02.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.00,0:02:02.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,好吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.24,0:02:04.72,EN,,0,0,0,,I love M&M's.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.24,0:02:04.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我超爱M&M豆。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.72,0:02:06.40,EN,,0,0,0,,I just saw on the interview,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.72,0:02:06.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,我刚在采访里看到，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.40,0:02:10.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Darderi chose the coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.40,0:02:10.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,达尔代里选的是咖啡。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.24,0:02:10.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.24,0:02:10.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.96,0:02:12.48,EN,,0,0,0,,And I chose the M&M's.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.96,0:02:12.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,而我选的是M&M豆。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.48,0:02:13.28,EN,,0,0,0,,You know what the good news
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.48,0:02:13.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.28,0:02:14.40,EN,,0,0,0,,is with your M&M's?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.28,0:02:14.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,吃M&M豆的好处是什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.40,0:02:15.36,EN,,0,0,0,,You didn't get a crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.40,0:02:15.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,不会像咖啡那样容易崩溃。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.36,0:02:16.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Poor Luciano.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.36,0:02:16.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,可怜的卢西亚诺。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.40,0:02:17.76,EN,,0,0,0,,He had so much coffee in Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.40,0:02:17.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,他在罗马喝了太多咖啡。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.76,0:02:20.40,EN,,0,0,0,,I think in the semis it was it was it was done
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.76,0:02:20.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,他到半决赛就撑不住了，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.40,0:02:21.60,EN,,0,0,0,,after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.40,0:02:21.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,之后就不行了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.60,0:02:23.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Maybe. Yes. But Luciano is a great player.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.60,0:02:23.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,也许吧，但他真的很棒。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.52,0:02:24.48,EN,,0,0,0,,He is he is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.52,0:02:24.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,他真的很厉害。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.48,0:02:25.84,EN,,0,0,0,,He's been having such a tremendous year.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.48,0:02:25.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,他今年状态特别出色。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.84,0:02:26.96,EN,,0,0,0,,All you Italians are playing
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.84,0:02:26.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们意大利人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.96,0:02:28.48,EN,,0,0,0,,such beautiful tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.96,0:02:28.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,这段网球都打得太漂亮了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.48,0:02:29.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Two three setters in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.48,0:02:29.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,接连打了两场三盘大战。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.84,0:02:31.60,EN,,0,0,0,,You now move into the semi-finals
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.84,0:02:31.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在你晋级了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.60,0:02:32.56,EN,,0,0,0,,over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.60,0:02:32.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,这里的半决赛。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.56,0:02:33.92,EN,,0,0,0,,What what emotions
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.56,0:02:33.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,面对这一切，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.92,0:02:35.12,EN,,0,0,0,,are you are you taking away
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.92,0:02:35.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,你现在的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.12,0:02:36.56,EN,,0,0,0,,from these because I know you reflect
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.12,0:02:36.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,是什么？我知道你会去复盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.56,0:02:37.36,EN,,0,0,0,,on these matches.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.56,0:02:37.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,这些比赛。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.36,0:02:39.04,EN,,0,0,0,,So, how will you take this energy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.36,0:02:39.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,那你要怎么把这股劲头
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.04,0:02:40.24,EN,,0,0,0,,into the next one?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.04,0:02:40.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,带进下一场？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.24,0:02:42.24,EN,,0,0,0,,It's easy for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.24,0:02:42.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我来说很简单。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.24,0:02:47.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Now I know that I have to cool down
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.24,0:02:47.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,我知道得让自己冷静下来，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.04,0:02:48.72,EN,,0,0,0,,and I have to do everything
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.04,0:02:48.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,该做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.72,0:02:52.48,EN,,0,0,0,,that I need to recharge my my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.72,0:02:52.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,都要用来恢复身体。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.48,0:02:54.00,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm really happy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.48,0:02:54.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.00,0:02:56.72,EN,,0,0,0,,that tomorrow I have I have the day off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.00,0:02:56.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,明天正好轮休。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.72,0:03:00.88,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I'm going to do some all and that's
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.72,0:03:00.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,我会好好安排一下，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.88,0:03:04.64,EN,,0,0,0,,the thing that I love in tennis day off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.88,0:03:04.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,这也是我最喜欢的一点。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.64,0:03:08.24,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I have time to recharge and I
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.64,0:03:08.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,这样我就有时间恢复，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.24,0:03:10.88,EN,,0,0,0,,have time to get ready for the next one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.24,0:03:10.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,也有时间为下一场做准备。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.88,0:03:13.04,EN,,0,0,0,,You know what the thing we love in tennis?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.88,0:03:13.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,你知道我们爱网球哪一点吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.04,0:03:15.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Flavio Cobolli entertaining us always.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.04,0:03:15.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,科博利总是能带来精彩。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.68,0:03:16.40,EN,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.68,0:03:16.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.40,0:03:17.68,EN,,0,0,0,,keep doing that. Congratulations
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.40,0:03:17.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,继续保持吧，恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.68,0:03:19.12,EN,,0,0,0,,on the victory today and
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.68,0:03:19.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天的这场胜利，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.12,0:03:20.40,EN,,0,0,0,,and enjoy the day off, my man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.12,0:03:20.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,好好享受休息日，老兄。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.40,0:03:21.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.40,0:03:21.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,太谢谢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.44,0:03:23.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Flavio Cobolli, ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.44,0:03:23.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,女士们先生们，科博利
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.44,0:03:24.00,EN,,0,0,0,,moves on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.44,0:03:24.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,晋级了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.00,0:03:26.32,EN,,0,0,0,,hard-fought victory over Tommy Paul
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.00,0:03:26.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,苦战力克汤米·保罗，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.32,0:03:27.68,EN,,0,0,0,,will move into the semis.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.32,0:03:27.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,挺进半决赛。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.68,0:03:29.74,EN,,0,0,0,,Who will he play?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.68,0:03:29.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,他的下一个对手会是谁？
